  "reviewer_note": "Tradition, not a dated event: the date is the source's own \"c. 13th century\" and the id's 1235 is only a label. The pin is Nyagassola, where UNESCO says the epic is kept alive; the epic's own setting (Mande, Nyani) was not located on an opened page. Scope kept separate from the Kirina and Mali Empire records.",
